5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Since this is the first day, we have no information yet. Let's observe everyone's behavior and communication patterns carefully. I suggest we all share our initial thoughts to see if any contradictions arise.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful idea, Minako dear. It is always best to start with a kind and open heart. I shall listen closely to everyone and hope we can find a peaceful resolution together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Since we have no clues yet, we should focus on how everyone reacts to the pressure. I'll be observing your logic and consistency. Let's see who tries too hard to blend in.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent approach, everyone. While we currently lack evidence, the subtle nuances of our discourse may reveal more than we expect. I shall be observing with equal curiosity and a touch of skepticism.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited to play! Let's all just be honest and help each other out. I'll do my best to figure out who the werewolf is with you guys!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Thank you all for agreeing. Since we are just starting, I want to remind everyone that the Possessed will likely try to mimic a Villager's logic. Let's stay vigilant and look for any unnatural alignment in our opinions.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"You are so thoughtful to remind us, Minako. It is true that things are not always as they seem. I hope we can all trust one another, but I will keep your wise words in mind.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. The Possessed is the most dangerous variable here because they can blend in perfectly. I'll be paying close attention to who supports whom too quickly or tries to steer the conversation away from certain people.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the Possessed is a master of camouflage. It would be quite a tragedy to mistake a wolf's accomplice for a simple villager. I shall enjoy watching this delicate dance of trust and deception.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, you guys are already thinking about the Possessed! That sounds super tricky. I'll just keep being myself and hope we can all work together to find the real wolf!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"We should consider how the Seer will handle their information. If the Seer finds the werewolf early, they must decide when to reveal themselves without becoming an immediate target. Let's keep that dynamic in mind.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a heavy burden for the Seer to carry, isn't it? I feel for them. We must be very gentle and supportive so they feel safe enough to guide us.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"While support is fine, the Seer needs a strategic environment, not just a gentle one. If the Seer reveals too early, the wolf will kill them immediately. We must be ready to protect them once the truth comes out.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,A strategic environment is indeed paramount. The Seer's revelation is a double-edged sword; it provides the light of truth but paints a target on their back. We must balance our need for clarity with the necessity of survival.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"That's a lot of big words! I don't know about ""double-edged swords,"" but I'll definitely help protect the Seer if they tell us who the bad guy is! We've got this!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"As we conclude the first day, let us remain composed. We have established our general approach. I will now focus on analyzing the consistency of everyone's statements as we move into the first night.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,It has been such a lovely conversation to start our journey. I shall wish you all a peaceful night's sleep. May we wake up tomorrow with a bit more clarity and kindness in our hearts.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I've noted everyone's initial stances. Kenji's openness is a contrast to the rest of us, which could be genuine or a facade. I'll be analyzing the shift in dynamics tomorrow.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A delightful opening act. I shall retire now to reflect on our introductions and await the revelations that the coming night may bring. Sleep well, everyone; may your dreams be untroubled.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams. I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
