67,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, what a tragedy. To wake up and find that poor Benjamin is gone, and Minako has been taken from us as well... my heart truly aches for our village. How could such things happen?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,This is a critical blow. Losing two people in one night—one by our hand and one by the wolf—leaves us extremely vulnerable. Minako was a logical anchor; her death suggests the wolf saw her as a threat.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I can't believe it! Minako is gone too? This is so scary! We were just talking to them yesterday. Who could do something so mean? We have to find the wolf fast before anyone else gets hurt!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is truly frightening, isn't it, Kenji? I can see you are trembling. Please, take a deep breath. We must stay strong and support each other now that our friends are gone.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Emotional support is fine, Shizue, but we need to be clinical. We are down to three people. If the wolf is among us, the game ends the moment one more human dies. We must identify the wolf now.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm trying to be clinical, but it's hard! Mizuki, you're so focused on the logic, but maybe the wolf is just pretending to be smart? I really want to find them, but I'm scared of making a mistake!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I understand your fear, Kenji dear. It is a heavy burden for us all. Mizuki, your focus is admirable, but let us not let our desperation cloud our judgment. Who among us do you suspect now?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we are the only three left, the logic is simple. If the wolf is here, it's either Shizue or Kenji. Shizue, your constant focus on emotions and kindness is a convenient shield. Are you hiding behind it?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, what?! Why are you pointing at Shizue and me? Shizue has been so nice to everyone! I can't believe you're being so mean when we're all scared. I'm just a kid, I'm not the wolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"My goodness, Mizuki, it is quite heartbreaking to see you cast suspicion on me after I have only wished for our peace. I am just a grandmother who cares for you all. Please, let us not be cruel.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Kindness is a tool, Shizue. In this game, the most effective disguise is often the one that seems most harmless. If you are the wolf, your ""grandmotherly"" act is the perfect cover. Kenji, stop panicking and think.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm thinking! But I can't just point fingers because I'm scared! Mizuki, you're acting like a detective, but that's exactly what a wolf would do to trick us! I trust Shizue, she's too sweet to be mean!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
